    \u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/05/14/4521515/5cfb5b76d3cb606de16485e78ccba817_4081651240127712995.png\\\"\u003e\\n      \u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e摩拉 10000\u003c/span\u003e\\n      \\n    \u003c/a\u003e\\n  \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1024\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/05/14/4521515/81f42f1f48a4f381c17f0d7e8cb934f3_6762973013843031851.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"冒险家的经验×4\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1024/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1024/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\\n      \u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/05/14/4521515/81f42f1f48a4f381c17f0d7e8cb934f3_6762973013843031851.png\\\"\u003e\\n      \u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e冒险家的经验×4\u003c/span\u003e\\n      \\n    \u003c/a\u003e\\n  \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1324","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e吉盖克斯：你好，想试试「风行迷踪」吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e旅行者：「风行迷踪」是什么？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e吉盖克斯：啊哈，问得好，「风行迷踪」是一款承载着蒙德城历史的游戏！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                你应该知道，在之前的蒙德城里有一群「贵族」吧\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                他们在蒙德城里暴行不断，让不少人都苦不堪言…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                为了反抗贵族们的种种暴行，有一群勇敢的蒙德人聚集了起来，形成了一个秘密的反抗组织\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                这群游侠们不断在蒙德各处展开行动，让贵族们颇吃了些苦头\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                但是，那些贵族们也很快训练出了一群用来镇「压」游侠们的爪牙。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e                于是，游侠们和贵族的爪牙们，就这样在蒙德各处展开了一场又一场的对决。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: justify;\\\"\u003e              「风行迷踪」，正是取材于这样史诗一般的真实历史事件！曾经也是很受欢迎的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e旅行者：曾经？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e吉盖克斯：是啊，现在城里的年轻人们对于「风行迷踪」可没多少兴趣了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e                但我可不想让「风行迷踪」就此失传，所以，我对它原来的规则做了些调整，让游戏规则更容易被理解\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e                除此之外，我还特意添加了好几张全新的游戏地图。我觉得，这样应该会有更多的人来玩吧…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1325","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动攻略","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:15px\\\"\u003e参加此活动避免社恐的小技巧[doge]：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:15px\\\"\u003e1.匹配成功时，聊天框发送表情【派蒙·吃惊】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:15px\\\"\u003e2.抓不到人时，聊天框发送表情【派蒙·吃惊】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:15px\\\"\u003e3.被猎人抓了，聊天框发送表情【派蒙·吃惊】\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/article/6136476\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e【V1.5攻略】#风行迷踪#大家一起来躲猫猫吧\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/article/6145930\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e【V1.5攻略】#风行迷踪#锤子躲猫猫，是攀岩毒圈加赛跑！\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1326","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1703034982","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"85","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"751","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1317","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"752","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1318","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"753","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1319","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"754","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1320","pos":"left"},{"id":"1321","pos":"right"},{"id":"1323","pos":"left"},{"id":"1322","pos":"right"},{"id":"1324","pos":"banner"},{"id":"1325","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_gr